{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33343","headline":"中秋夜思郑延美有作 · 孙纬","name":"中秋夜思郑延美有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中秋中夜月，世说慴妖精。\n顾兔云初蔽，长虵谁与勍。\n未追良友翫，安用玉轮盈。\n此意人谁喻，裁时穿禁城。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙纬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33343.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33343","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}